  "details": "in TMP dropdown it could be very useful if it was possible for you to customize each item it has more. Like maybe change the background, so that instead of all items havin same background, you can change them individually through a code.\n\nAnother thing would be to have support for scriptable objects.\n\nRight now I'm using a system, where I have an empty that has more empties inside (categories) and then inside the empties there are more empties with a script (roles).\n\nBut if it was possible to get the data from scriptable objects, then I could just have a \"database\" inside the category empties and through them I can access the data I require, making codes shorter due to there being less navigation in hierarchy needed.",
